isolation). Byte-for-byte identical: `handlers.go`, `base.js`, all five
templates (`bigticket-card.html`, `expense-sources-list.html`,
`income-sources-list.html`, `onetime-card.html`, `pages/whatif.html`).
This means the entire rendered DOM/CSS/JS surface a11y audit runs against
