## 12. Regression tests — corroborating

`go test ./internal/handlers/whatif/...` → ok (9.6s). `node --test
web/static/js/base.test.cjs` → **12/12 pass**, including the two new
attempt-3 tests (`M1`: load-triggered sentinel under a non-forbidden
parent still gets no inline error; `M2`: an eligible form-less control
whose only host is forbidden still gets no inline error) — these isolate
the two guards in `errorHost()` that attempt-2's tests had left
conflated, closing the mutation-testing gap checker-tests found in WS4.2.
Not the a11y audit itself, but confirms the traced client behavior isn't
a fluke of my specific probe inputs.

