tests) touches no rendered surface; independently re-verified live
against both themes anyway rather than resting on that claim. Every
check the brief named passes: retargeted Add rejections (income,
expense, live; bigticket/onetime/healthcare, route-intercepted) single
`role="alert"` no nesting (ariaSnapshot-confirmed); non-retargeted
edit-row rejection single-announced with focus retained; synthetic 5xx
and text/plain bodies handled safely; poll sentinel never re-announces;
no page-load noise; reportValidity blocks and keeps focus; contrast
5.72:1 light / 8.88:1 dark; keyboard-only submission works with a
visible focus ring; landmarks/heading structure intact. One PRE-EXISTING,
out-of-scope 320px reflow defect (unrelated Big-Ticket button, present on
